8}, {"i": 394, "text": "rain", "start": 148.508, "end": 148.729}, {"i": 395, "text": "from", "start": 148.749, "end": 148.909}, {"i": 396, "text": "Friday,", "start": 148.969, "end": 149.41}, {"i": 397, "text": "which", "start": 149.65, "end": 149.79}, {"i": 398, "text": "will", "start": 149.83, "end": 149.971}, {"i": 399, "text": "ruin", "start": 150.011, "end": 150.251}, {"i": 400, "text": "everything", "start": 150.431, "end": 150.832}, {"i": 401, "text": "I", "start": 150.892, "end": 150.952}, {"i": 402, "text": "had", "start": 150.992, "end": 151.133}, {"i": 403, "text": "planned.", "start": 151.193, "end": 151.573}, {"i": 404, "text": "Then", "start": 152.455, "end": 152.635}, {"i": 405, "text": "let", "start": 152.695, "end": 152.855}, {"i": 406, "text": "us", "start": 152.915, "end": 152.996}, {"i": 407, "text": "hope", "start": 153.036, "end": 153.216}, {"i": 408, "text": "they", "start": 153.256, "end": 153.396}, {"i": 409, "text": "have", "start": 153.436, "end": 153.557}, {"i": 410, "text": "it", "start": 153.597, "end": 153.657}, {"i": 411, "text": "wrong.", "start": 153.717, "end": 154.017}, {"i": 412, "text": "Take", "start": 154.598, "end": 154.819}, {"i": 413, "text": "care,", "start": 154.839, "end": 155.079}, {"i": 414, "text": "Frederick.", "start": 155.179, "end": 155.62}], "segments": [{"start": 0.062, "end": 0.382, "text": "morning."}, {"start": 0.983, "end": 2.144, "text": "Sorry if I am a minute late."}, {"start": 2.604, "end": 6.888, "text": "The car park was completely full and I ended up circling it twice before a space opened up."}, {"start": 7.668, "end": 8.889, "text": "No harm done, Frederick."}, {"start": 9.43, "end": 12.032, "text": "That car park defeats everyone on a Monday."}, {"start": 12.673, "end": 13.093, "text": "Sit down."}, {"start": 13.814, "end": 15.115, "text": "What is on your mind today?"}, {"start": 16.055, "end": 19.558, "text": "Well, it is a slightly awkward one, but here we go."}, {"start": 20.739, "end": 23.582, "text": "I have felt something unusual on the right side of my scrotum."}, {"start": 24.322, "end": 26.164, "text": "Something that is not how it normally is."}, {"start": 27.225, "end": 28.486, "text": "Thank you for coming in with it."}, {"start": 29.054, "end": 32.015, "text": "That is exactly the sort of thing I would rather hear about."}, {"start": 32.775, "end": 34.355, "text": "Have you had any fever with it?"}, {"start": 35.336, "end": 35.836, "text": "No fever."}, {"start": 36.436, "end": 37.396, "text": "Nothing like that at all."}, {"start": 38.217, "end": 42.858, "text": "I have felt perfectly well otherwise, which is partly why I dithered about booking an appointment."}, {"start": 43.838, "end": 44.118, "text": "Good."}, {"start": 44.738, "end": 47.499, "text": "I would like to examine you, if that is all right with you."}, {"start": 48.499, "end": 49.14, "text": "Yes, of course."}, {"start": 49.58, "end": 50.02, "text": "Go ahead."}, {"start": 51.24, "end": 57.462, "text": "I can feel a small swelling around the epididymis on the right, and there is slight tenderness there."}, {"start": 58.514, "end": 59.174, "text": "A swelling."}, {"start": 59.995, "end": 60.295, "text": "Right."}, {"start": 61.195, "end": 62.896, "text": "And that would be the thing I have been feeling?"}, {"start": 63.916, "end": 65.897, "text": "It fits what you describe, yes."}, {"start": 66.598, "end": 69.939, "text": "The testicles themselves feel normal to me on both sides."}, {"start": 71.179, "end": 72.7, "text": "Normal on both sides."}, {"start": 74.621, "end": 77.402, "text": "Well, that is the sentence I was hoping for, honestly."}, {"start": 78.443, "end": 79.343, "text": "I thought it might be."}, {"start": 80.183, "end": 86.146, "text": "What I suspect is a spermatocele, which is a small fluid-filled cyst by the epididymis."}, {"start": 87.302, "end": 88.462, "text": "A spermatocele."}, {"start": 89.323, "end": 91.863, "text": "I have genuinely never heard that word in my life."}, {"start": 92.924, "end": 93.964, "text": "Is it something serious?"}, {"start": 95.144, "end": 99.225, "text": "It is a suspicion at this stage, not a confirmed diagnosis."}, {"start": 99.986, "end": 103.747, "text": "I want you to be clear about that, because it shapes what we do next."}, {"start": 104.967, "end": 105.347, "text": "All right."}, {"start": 106.227, "end": 107.168, "text": "So what do we do next?"}, {"start": 108.208, "end": 109.488, "text": "I would rather hear it plainly."}, {"start": 109.628, "end": 111.369, "text": "We wait and see how it develops."}, {"start": 111.869, "end": 113.77, "text": "That is the plan I would recommend here."}, {"start": 114.57, "end": 115.23, "text": "Just wait."}, {"start": 116.262, "end": 119.003, "text": "I will be honest, part of me wants something done today."}, {"start": 119.824, "end": 122.685, "text": "But if waiting is the right call, then I will go along with it."}, {"start": 123.485, "end": 127.667, "text": "It is, and I want you properly informed rather than simply told."}, {"start": 128.267, "end": 130.228, "text": "Ask me anything you are unsure about."}, {"start": 131.008, "end": 131.749, "text": "I think I have it."}, {"start": 132.509, "end": 137.531, "text": "Something on the right side, probably a spermatocele, and we keep an eye on how it develops."}, {"start": 138.231, "end": 139.012, "text": "Have I got that right?"}, {"start": 139.852, "end": 141.133, "text": "That is it exactly."}, {"start": 141.573, "end": 142.733, "text": "Are you comfortable with that?"}, {"start": 143.574, "end": 143.894, "text": "I am."}, {"start": 144.702, "end": 146.826, "text": "And now I only have the weekend to worry about."}, {"start": 147.667, "end": 151.573, "text": "They are promising rain from Friday, which will ruin everything I had planned."}, {"start": 152.455, "end": 154.017, "text": "Then let us hope they have it wrong."}, {"start": 154.598, "end": 155.62, "text": "Take care, Frederick."}], "machine": "gpu59.int.triton.aalto.fi", "git_commit": "735eed3a1a4f5d8bc8a3ac1f1c8897e291443b9f", "date": "2026-09-20", "timing_s": {"transcribe_and_align": 2.68}}